Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|test.run.environment|EE|
		|testray.main.component.name|Kaleo Designer|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|test.run.environment|EE|
		|testray.main.component.name|Kaleo Designer|
		|kfFieldSetName|New Kaleo Field Set|
		|workflowAssetType|Process|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Kaleo Designer|
	Then KaleoDesigner edit Workflow Definition Via KDCP
		|workflowDefinitionTitle|Single Approver|
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Delete Task Node
Priority: 5
	Given KaleoDesigner edit Workflow Definition Title Via Workflow CP
		|workflowDefinitionTitle|Edited Workflow Definition|
	When KaleoDesigner select Node
		|nodeNodeLabel|update|
	And KaleoDesigner delete Node
		|nodeNodeLabel|update|
	And KaleoDesigner publish Workflow Definition Via KDCP
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Kaleo Designer|
	And KaleoDesigner view Table Definition Published Via KDCP
		|workflowDefinitionName|Single Approver|
		|workflowDefinitionTitle|Edited Workflow Definition|
		|workflowDefinitionVersionNumber|2|
	And KaleoDesigner edit Workflow Definition Via KDCP
		|workflowDefinitionTitle|Edited Workflow Definition|
	Then KaleoDesigner view Node Not Present
		|nodeNodeLabel|update|
Scenario: View Invalid Source XML Remains After Tab Switch
Priority: 4
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When KaleoDesigner edit Source XML
		|kdSourceXML|INVALID|
		|line|6|
	And KaleoDesigner view View Tab
	And KaleoDesigner view Source XML Tab
	Then KaleoDesigner view Source XML Line
		|kdSourceXML|INVALID|
		|line|6|
Scenario: View Node Notification Recipient Persists After Switching Tabs
Priority: 4
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When KaleoDesigner select Node
		|nodeNodeLabel|review|
	And KaleoDesigner edit Node Notifications
		|nodeNotificationsDescription|Review Notification Description|
		|nodeNotificationsName|Review Notification|
		|nodeNotificationsRecipientType|Role Type|
		|roleName|Administrator|
		|roleType|Regular|
	And KaleoDesigner view Source XML Tab
	And KaleoDesigner view View Tab
	And KaleoDesigner select Node
		|nodeNodeLabel|review|
	Then KaleoDesigner view Node Notifications
		|nodeNotificationsName|Review Notification|
		|nodeNotificationsRecipientType|Role Type|
		|roleName|Administrator|
		|roleType|Regular|
